title: Renewal pipeline to renewed policy
participant J "Scheduler"
participant N "Renewals module"
participant U "Operations / Sales & Marketing"
participant C "Client"
participant D "PostgreSQL"
J -> N: renewal-pipeline job (daily): enrol policies expiring within renewals.pipeline_days (90)
N -> D: renewal RN- per policy; lapse open renewals past renewals.grace_period_days (30)
J -> N: renewal-notices job (daily): reminders at limits.renewal_notice_days (60, 30, 15)
N -> D: notifications; renewal-queue job (every minute) sends queued batch notices
U -> N: renewal quote (RQ- or quotation linked to the expiring policy); negotiate; activities logged
N -> C: quotation e-mailed for customer approval
C --> N: accepts
U -> N: issue renewal: convert quotation to policy
N -> D: new policy POL-; old policy status renewed (renewed_to); renewal renewed; new bill and commission
J -> D: policy-expiry job (daily): status expired for policies past expiry
